# Enterprise Governance Rules

## 1. Repository Governance

- CODEOWNERS assigns ownership per directory/path for automated review assignments.
- CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md and SECURITY.md are required in every repository.
- Branch protection on `main`: requires 2+ reviews, all status checks passing, up-to-date branch.

## 2. Release Management

1. Only release managers can create and push tags.
2. All releases must have a corresponding CHANGELOG.md entry.
3. Hotfixes must go through the hotfix branch process — never modify a release tag directly.
4. Version numbers must be consistent: git tag = package version = CHANGELOG entry.
5. All release tags must be GPG signed.

## 3. Release Workflow

```
feature branch → PR → squash merge to main
                      ↓
                 release branch → merge commit
                      ↓
              git tag -s vX.Y.Z → push tag → release.yml triggered
                      ↓
              hotfix branch (from tag) → merge commit → new tag
```

## 4. Security Compliance

- CodeQL analysis runs on every PR and weekly schedule.
- Dependabot auto-creates dependency update PRs.
- Dependency Review checks license and known vulnerabilities on every PR.
- SECURITY.md defines the vulnerability disclosure process.
- Critical security issues auto-notify project owner.

## 5. Issue & Task Management

| Issue Type | Template | Labels |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Bug Report | 01-bug-report.yml | bug |
| Feature Request | 02-feature-request.yml | enhancement |
| Task | 03-task.yml | task |
| Documentation | 04-documentation.yml | docs |
| Epic | 05-epic.yml | epic |

## 6. CI/CD Workflows (12 workflows)

| Workflow | Trigger | Purpose |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `ci.yml` | Push to any branch | Build, lint, matrix test, coverage |
| `pr-conventions.yml` | PR opened/edited | Title format, size check |
| `pr-auto-assign.yml` | PR opened | Auto-assign reviewer from CODEOWNERS |
| `merge-queue.yml` | Merge queue | Validate before merge |
| `codeql-analysis.yml` | PR + schedule | Security code scanning |
| `dependency-review.yml` | PR | License + CVE checks |
| `release.yml` | Tag push | Build, test, publish artifacts |
| `release-branch.yml` | Branch `release/*` | Release branch CI |
| `hotfix.yml` | Branch `hotfix/*` | Hotfix CI + deploy |
| `deploy-pages.yml` | Push to main | GitHub Pages deployment |
| `issue-triage.yml` | Issue opened/edited | Auto-label, assign |
| `stale.yml` | Schedule | Mark/close stale issues and PRs |

## 7. Environment Variables (Required for CI)

| Variable | Permission | Purpose |
|----------|-----------|---------|
| `GITHUB_TOKEN` | `contents: write`, `pull-requests: write` | PR/Release operations |
| `CODECOV_TOKEN` | N/A | Coverage reporting |
| `DOCKER_USERNAME` / `DOCKER_PASSWORD` | N/A | Docker Hub publishing |
| `NPM_TOKEN` / `PYPI_TOKEN` | N/A | Package registry publishing |
